</ul>

<div class="note">
  <b>TAX must recalculate, not be a fixed number</b>
  <p>Today the panel shows <code>Package Price 3,748.06 → TAX 562.21 → Total 4,310.27</code> — exactly 15%. When rooms or add-ons change, TAX has to be recomputed from the new base. Whether add-ons attract the same rate is a finance question — see question 4.</p>
